      "message": "I will use com.android.bluetooth.flags.Flags.metadataApiMicrophoneForCallEnabled() in SettingsLib, and it will be the build error if I don\u0027t add visibility here.\n\nWhat I changed in SettingsLib/Android.bp:\n```\njava_aconfig_library {\n    name: \"bluetooth_flags\",\n    aconfig_declarations: \"bluetooth_aconfig_flags\",\n    mode: \"exported\",\n}\n```\n\n\nError message:\n```\nerror: frameworks/base/packages/SettingsLib/Android.bp:125:1: module \"bluetooth_flags\" variant \"android_common\": depends on //packages/modules/Bluetooth/flags:bluetooth_aconfig_\nflags which is not visible to this module\nYou may need to add \"//frameworks/base/packages/SettingsLib\" to its visibility\n```",
